SUMMARY:Longford Park and Reynold's Dog Park- route along canal
DESCRIPTION:Walking Tails\nThis is a **Saturday** walk. We will walk along
  the canal. The trail in this direction is dirt and gravel. We will go out
  about 1.5 miles and then come back the way we came\, for a total of 3 mil
 es. CLICK DIRECTLY ON THE MAP IF YOU THINK YOU ARE LOST. IT WILL BRING YOU
  RIGHT TO US WHERE WE MEET.\n\nWe will be meeting near the dog park\, come
  early and let your dog play off leash in the dog park.\n\nStart Time: We 
 will start hiking promptly at the scheduled time.\n\nDuration of the walk 
 – depends on the people and dogs in the group. We frequently end up walk
 ing in smaller packs based on the comfort level of the participants. In th
 e past this walk takes about 1 hour or so.\n\nPlease remember pooh bags an
 d that your dog must be on a leash that is no more than 10 feet long.\n\nF
 acilities: There are bathrooms at the dog park\n\nNOTICE: By attending thi
 s event you are agreeing that YOU ARE RESPONSIBLE FOR YOUR OWN SAFETY AT A
 LL TIMES. The hike leader and other members cannot be held responsible for
  any damages\, accidents\, or liabilities incurred while hiking with us.
